OL,3,ACatholic bishops apologise for
OL,4,A'exploited' Trump meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump and Pope Leo XIV have a
OL,7,Fcontentious relationship, and some US
OL,8,Fbishops have criticised the
OL,9,Fadministration's immigration policies.
OL,10,FBut Trump has typically enjoyed the
OL,11,Fsupport of Catholic voters.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
